  "implementation": [
    "Pointer drag inserts a pending field into left-types/center-canvas/right-properties designer. Save replaces its pending code and width with the persisted field code.",
    "One SchemaFormLayout consumes section titles/order/columns/spans in designer preview and runtime create/edit. Reused RuntimeFieldInput covers text, number, money, date/datetime, boolean, fixed single selection/status, rich text and structured JSON.",
    "Existing field configuration extracted into ModuleFieldProperties and reused, including pre-existing specialized type controls. Remaining type families are not claimed complete.",
    "Draft and publication share FormLayoutProtocol validation. Reject duplicate/unknown references, inconsistent section order/range, invalid columns/spans and overflowing integer widths.",
    "Unsaved layout/field changes block task/tab/module/navigation/refresh changes. Explicit draft save and publish show errors; unchanged layouts avoid redundant writes.",
    "Long-form toolbar and both side panels remain visible while scrolling. Existing unrelated layout metadata and non-SECTION components are retained."
  ],
